{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41898","headline":"庐山 · 李中","name":"庐山","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"控厌浔阳景，崔嵬古及今。\n势雄超地表，翠盛接天心。\n湓浦春烟列，星湾晚景沈。\n图经宜细览，题咏卒难任。\n靖节门遥对，庾公楼俯临。\n参差含积雪，隐映见归禽。\n峭拔推双劒，清虚数二林。\n白莲池宛在，翠辇事难寻。\n天近星河冷，龙归洞穴深。\n谷春攒锦绣，石润叠琼琳。\n玄鹤传仙拜，青猨伴客吟。\n泉通九江远，云出几州阴。\n冬有灵汤溢，夏无炎暑侵。\n他年如遂隐，五老是知音。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李中","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_41898.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41898","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}